cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the code, cite this repository. If you refer to the results, cite the preprint."
title: "llm-token-architect: Quote Guard, the Attention Dispersion study and its audit protocol"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic pre-flight check that stops an autonomous agent from hanging its
  own shell on an unbalanced quote, together with the experimental study it came
  from (1,416 canonical probes on autoregressive transformers), the popular
  trilogy written about it, and the protocol for auditing the claims made in the
  study. Code is MIT; the papers and the trilogy are CC BY 4.0.
